{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/extras/0182c3e826e6ce5b4f8c4b94707b7916.avif?t=1766000495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/extras_big/0182c3e826e6ce5b4f8c4b94707b7916.webp?t=1766000495 width=1560 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive in the thoughts of a trans girl that doesn\u2019t know it yet, through her voice, through her diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See her grow and her view of her body and romance evolve, as well as the way she deals with her emotions, and discovers more about herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is also conveyed through the gameplay that reacts to her voice, to the story. You\u2019ll feel her struggles and joys through your hands and ears and maybe even through your heart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is easy to pick up, as you\u2019ll have only one action: dashing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll aim at a direction with your mouse or stick and decide when to dash to solve puzzles and squeeze through tightly designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/extras/a626adb8f7212d2d679f452a5396ea77.poster.avif?t=1766000495\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/extras/a626adb8f7212d2d679f452a5396ea77.webm?t=1766000495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These simple controls doesn\u2019t mean that all will be easy, as the game offers a variety of challenges: puzzles, platforming challenges, and even rhythm based levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional story where you\u2019ll see the character grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting to immerse you completely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible yet deep gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delicately crafted levels that support the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique handcrafted illustrations that reflect the mental state of the protagonist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/extras/f0c1cd65eebf84b4cbdbc1cbf92c0f72.avif?t=1766000495\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/extras_big/f0c1cd65eebf84b4cbdbc1cbf92c0f72.webp?t=1766000495 width=1560 height=411 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037190?t=1766000495","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/8df08c21ceaed076e0c50f35108f5b469f7ee7fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766000495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/085c23e4765f4f44809bea428bd024a53b28c42d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766000495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037190/085c23e4765f4f44809bea428bd024a53b28c42d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766000495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":